  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;The proposed hot food takeaway is unacceptable in principle as it would result in an increased hot food takeaway provision in too close proximity to the nearby Hatch End High School and Shaftesbury High School, contributing to childhood obesity within London. This results in a use which would not be compatible with Policy HC5 of the NPPF (2026) and Policy E9 of The London Plan (2021).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;It has not been demonstrated that the proposed Air Conditioning unit, air inlet and extract flue, and odour control measures will not have an adverse amenity impact on any nearby residential dwellings in terms of noise, disturbance and excess odour, contrary National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policy D3, D13 of the London Plan (2021), policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ]
